        <activityName xml:lang="en">Concrete mixing plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Concrete mixing plant
The lifespan of the insfrastructure and the land occupation is assumed to be 50 years. The average yearly production is about 100'000 t/a;
UUID: 4f1783a8-2442-3468-9153-8f815e4e95a8
includes the area of the infrastructure (buildings, roads, etc.) and the machines used for the ready-mixed concrete production
Location: For some exchanges RER-modules have been used as proxy
Technology: The data of the infrastructure corresponds tohigh level of technology
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Measured data of 6 Swiss plants 
Extrapolations: See geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4f1783a8-2442-3468-9153-8f815e4e95a8.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
